cmockery2
------------------------------------------
Reviving cmockery unit test framework from Google

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcmockery-devel-1.3.9-1bl2
  libcmockery0-1.3.9-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/lpabon/cmockery2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/lpabon/cmockery2/archive/refs/tags/v1.3.9.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cmockery2-1.3.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cmockery2-1.3.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cmockery2-1.3.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cmockery2-1.3.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcmockery0-1.3.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcmockery-devel-1.3.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cmockery2)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cmockery2.README
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/README
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/coverage.md
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/index.html
  /usr/share/doc/cmockery2/usage.md

(libcmockery0)
  /usr/bin/cygcmockery-0.dll

(libcmockery-devel)
  /usr/include/cmockery/cmockery.h
  /usr/include/cmockery/cmockery_override.h
  /usr/include/cmockery/pbc.h
  /usr/lib/libcmockery.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/cmockery2.pc

